column3:
Daily fixture manager update: reserve fixtures, queued fixture news, removal of AI-only friendlies and cup round labels. 
 `FIXTURE_MANAGER::daily_update()`, from the day loop (0x5cc850); SEH frame with no destructor on the normal path (the local dates). By today's weekday (`exe::date_get_weekday` on `G_CURRENT_DATE`): 
 1. days 2 and 3: the reserve fixtures for 3 days ahead (`exe::date_add_days` + `exe::reservecomp_schedule_reserve_fixtures`: push &date; mov ecx, [`G_RESERVE_COMP`] -> thiscall, ret 4) and, on day 3, also for tomorrow; 
 2. the fixture news queue (`fixture_manager::MOVED_NEWS_QUEUE`, a list): each news item goes to the manager of the club in slot 0 if slot 0xe asks for it and to the manager of the club in slot 1 if slot 0xf asks for it (`exe::newsitem_get_slot`: push k; mov ecx, news -> thiscall, ret 4; `exe::news_send_to_club_manager`: push club; push news; mov ecx, [`G_NEWS`] -> thiscall, ret 8); the list is destroyed (`exe::drop_llist` + `exe::crt_operator_delete`) and `fixture_manager::MOVED_NEWS_QUEUE` becomes 0; 
 3. days 5 and 6, if yesterday is in the same year: in yesterday's lists (the 3 slices, the key nations up to `G_KEY_NATION_ACTIVE_COUNT`), from back to front, the friendlies (`KEY_CLUB_COMP_RESERVE`, `fixture::CATEGORY` = 1) between two clubs without a human manager leave the list (`exe::llist_get_prev` + `exe::llist_remove_node`); the first fixture that is not a friendly of that type ends the list; 
 4. the leg check list (`G_FIXTURE_LEGS_LIST`): each entry whose cup (or its stage +4) has `cup::COMP_TYPE` = 1 labels the following fixtures of the round (`exe::cup_label_round_extra_fixtures`: push `fixture_leg_check::AWAY_CLUB_ID`; push +7; push round; ecx = the cup -> thiscall, ret 0xc); the list is emptied (`exe::llist_clear`).
